:expect-pins 4
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-21.

# The supplied-record ballot consequence remains absent while adulthood evidence is disputed.
? decide(Hano, Ballot).
# => FALSE

# Missing maturity cannot erase personhood.
? person(Hano).
# => TRUE

# The claimant can make the disputed status visible.
? err(Hano, MaturityDispute).
# => TRUE

# The challenge derives a duty without pretending the ballot is restored.
? obliged(Appeals, Hano).
# => TRUE
